      ],
      "source": "https://issuu.com/sunflower_publishing/docs/leawood23fawi-singles/s/36861427",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Leawood Historic Commission was founded in 1993 to protect the village’s heritage and historic sites.",
